{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54089","headline":"将归寂有偈 · 从朗","name":"将归寂有偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来住木陈，时中无一假功成。\n有人问我西来意，展似眉毛作麽生。\n（见《大正藏》本《景德传灯录》卷十一〖影宋本无〗、《五灯会元》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从朗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}